      {
        "label": "D-5 Extend the pilot to fourteen merchants",
        "raw": "/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/decisions?decision=1a34c512-9fdc-497c-a07c-9b75f49edcc3",
        "href": "/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/decisions?decision=1a34c512-9fdc-497c-a07c-9b75f49edcc3",
        "targetId": "1a34c512-9fdc-497c-a07c-9b75f49edcc3",
        "resolves": true
      }
    ],
    "answer": "The pilot was initially limited to eleven merchants because the vendor reconciliation service could not handle a larger volume. This decision was made on 2026-09-14, superseding a plan for a twenty-five merchant pilot [D-2 Limit the pilot to eleven merchants](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/decisions?decision=25b25d39-ae87-4190-9c0c-17dcc05ca2ab).\n\nHowever, on 2026-09-25, the pilot was extended to fourteen merchants after three additional merchants requested to join and the reconciliation harness was updated to cover their settlement plan. Holding the pilot at eleven merchants was rejected at that time [D-5 Extend the pilot to fourteen merchants](/projects/2415ccf7-9c11-4023-b933-f5ab9db037d3/decisions?decision=1a34c512-9fdc-497c-a07c-9b75f49edcc3).",
    "finishReason": "stop"
  },
